ind":"update","title":"Demo 1.3 Update Announcement","summary":"Hello everyone! Demo 1.3 is now available! New Content:Each angel has a new exclusive minigame with 3 difficulty levels. Beat them to unlock 3 illustrations.Improvements:Polished multi-language translation textsAdded mining targeting cursor, fixed mining position offset issueRevised opening story and the third story segment of Israfel to strengthen the protagonist’s agencyBug Fixes:Fixed an issue where holding the space key would corrupt the gallery displayPlease try out the new build. If you en","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T03:14:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939863","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4655130-1844115010501023","game_id":"steam-4655130","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.2 Update Announcement","summary":"Hi everyone! Demo 1.2 is now available.ImprovementsRenamed the resource \"Divine Power\" to \"Affection\" and adjusted its UI layout.Added full‑body portrait preview in the outfit change screen.Added damage reduction prompt when clicking burrowing monsters.Added new mechanics for enemies in Stage 3 and Stage 5.Added tutorial guidance for the first boss stage.Added heart indicator below the Fallen Angel, the Stage 4 boss.Optimized the gem interface layout for clearer display.Filled in some missing lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T10:46:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501023","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:36:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4655130-1843481262700926","game_id":"steam-4655130","kind":"update","title":"Demo 1.1 Update","summary":"Hi everyone! Demo version 1.1 is now live.Improvement